Progress pose guide diagrams
============================

Layout (gender-specific; resolved from profile ``User.sex``):

  male/{front,side,back,overview}.png
  female/{…same…}.png

Fallback: if profile sex is unset, guides use the ``male`` folder
(onboarding normally sets sex first).

Per-angle cards: instructional silhouettes with unified chrome
(dark-navy footer, yellow circle + ruler icon, yellow CTA):
  front → «фронт», side → «бок», back → «спина».
Overview uses the same chrome family with footer «3 ракурса».

Gender pipeline rule: regenerator never copies male↔female. Staging filenames
should be ``{male,female}_progress_{front,side,back,overview}[.png]``
(optional ``_v2``). Bare ``male_overview_v2.png`` belongs to measurement guides
and is intentionally ignored for progress overviews.

License: project-authored instructional illustrations / restyled cards (CC0 1.0
for chrome and project originals).

Regenerate / restamp (dev machine, Pillow not a runtime dependency):

  uv run --with pillow python scripts/generate_progress_pose_images.py
